{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n　　\n「1st TOUR 2021」in 福岡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に足を運んで下さった皆様、ありがとうございました！\nやはり直接会えるのは本当に幸せだなと、改めて何度も何度も思いました^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温かすぎる福岡の皆様のおかげで、最高の思い出がツアー1つ目の場所にして、いくつも出来ました🍂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SF7S9HTX6JK7EE0HNN2WT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目の終演後には、3rdシングル「流れ弾」のMVをサプライズ初解禁させていただきました🥀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVを見て下さっている皆様の顔を舞台裏で見ながら、色々な熱い思いが込み上げてきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後のYouTubeプレミア公開もメンバーと一緒に、沢山届いて欲しいねと願いながら見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に多くの方の目に、耳に、心に、届いて欲しい作品です。\n私たちも全力で届けていきます！　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SF8ZZNFBTJQ7NC5X1YTZX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいまミート&グリート 第6次応募が行われております！\nMVの感想やツアーの話、楽曲の話、色々な想いをお話出来たら嬉しいです^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるね〜😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://fortunemusic.jp/sakurazaka46_202110/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFA108P1SWDNC0FN8S8ZG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFB307TSBRN9H0Y2QNKXW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFC4J40SB4BS4DAF7BSNC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFD4FDR3TSAFEZM31EQA8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFE5JTY3YBV0FJG8QQ60Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　\nマネージャーさんが撮ってくれました💃🏻📸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に。\n小林由依さんの休養が先日発表されました。\n櫻坂46になってからもうすぐ一年、色んなことがありました。\nこの一年間、私自身が背中を追い続けてきたのは、\nどんな時も変わらず由依さんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFF9RFE90PVCVRYXK89CQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり、休んでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちは変わらず、がむしゃらに、\n前に進んでいくのみだと思っております。\n皆様も、またいつものように櫻坂46に、パワーを送り続けて下さったら嬉しいです^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知の皆さん、待っててね！🪐　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0SFG9THB45PXP8147E55PX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}],"source":"archive"}